            "ADVANTAGE DESCRIPTIONS",
            "detailed"
          ],
          [
            [
              "BOXER",
              "",
              "You gain d8 when you use Brawl to punch, kick, headbutt, or otherwise injure another character using nothing but your own body."
            ],
            [
              "STAREDOWN",
              "",
              "Spend a hero point to intimidate a character into backing down from a threat, letting you into somewhere he shouldn’t, or otherwise getting out of your way."
            ],
            [
              "VIRTUOSO: WRESTLING",
              "",
              "Choose a specific Performance type, such as singing, playing a specific musical instrument, or dancing. You gain d8 when you Perform using that art."
            ],
            [
              "INSPIRE GENEROSITY",
              "",
              "Spend a hero point to convince another character to grant you an object you want at no cost. They might give you something they already have or go to some lengths—legal or illegal—to procure the item, whatever is the easiest way for them to get their hands on what you want."
            ],
            [
              "EAGLE EYE",
              "",
              "As long as you have a clear line of sight, you can see perfectly out to a distance of one mile. If you use a spyglass you can even pick out fine details, such as the inscription carved into a wedding band. If a Test relies heavily on your keen vision, you gain d8."
            ],
            [
              "SEA LEGS",
              "",
              "While aboard a ship, treacherous footing never affects you. You gain d8 on any physical Test while aboard a ship at sea—engaging in a sword fight on a pitching ship deck, or climbing through the rigging during a storm."
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ],
