          ],
          [
            [
              "SORCERY: TRANSFORMATION",
              "",
              "Once per scene, you make take the form of one of these creatures for the remainder of the scene:",
              "- Otter",
              "- Bear",
              "- Boar",
              "- Cat",
              "- Fish",
              "- Fox",
              "- Goat",
              "- Horse",
              "- Mouse",
              "- Owl",
              "- Rabbit",
              "- Raven",
              "- Reindeer",
              "- Snake",
              "- Turtle",
              "- Wolf",
              "",
              "Your skills, knowledge, and abilities are all retained in your new form—although they may be limited, such as Weaponry being unusable if you cannot hold weapons. If the animal’s form would be particularly advantageous (such as trying to avoid notice while you are in the form of a mouse), you gain d10."
            ]
          ]
        ]
